Summary statistics



Table 1: Mean bill length and depth by species.


penguins |&gt;
    drop_na() |&gt;
    group_by(species) |&gt;
    summarise(
        mean_bill_length = mean(bill_length_mm), 
        mean_bill_depth = mean(bill_depth_mm),
        n = n()
    )

# A tibble: 3 × 4
  species   mean_bill_length mean_bill_depth     n
  &lt;fct&gt;                &lt;dbl&gt;           &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;int&gt;
1 Adelie                38.8            18.3   146
2 Chinstrap             48.8            18.4    68
3 Gentoo                47.6            15.0   119
